# Project Rules

- Keep the core Python-first.
- Do not add Java as a core runtime.
- Add Rust/C++ only after profiling identifies a bottleneck.
- Keep modules behind the existing pipeline boundaries.
- Do not add hosted APIs or graph databases to the core path without an explicit task.
- Read `AGENTS.md` and the relevant docs before broad changes.
